[I] Lua utility libraries loosely based on the Python standard libraries

[T] Penlight is a set of pure Lua libraries focusing on input data handling,
[T] functional programming and OS path management, used by ldoc.

[U] https://github.com/lunarmodules/Penlight

[A] Steve Donovan
